# Mobile UI — Insta Connect

- Theme tokens: `@/src/theme/colors`, `@/src/theme/spacing` (includes `radius`)
- UI components: `@/src/components/ui/*` — prefer reuse over new primitives
- Layout: `Screen` wrapper; `ScreenHeader` for in-app screens with navigation
- Styling: React Native `StyleSheet` only; no Tailwind/NativeWind
- Icons: `lucide-react-native` (size 20–22 for actions)
- Copy: Brazilian Portuguese (pt-BR)
- Do not use `constants/Colors.ts` or `components/Themed.tsx`
- Touch targets: min 44–48px; use `Button` for primary actions
- For design guidance, read `.cursor/skills/mobile-design/SKILL.md`
- For new Expo APIs, check https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v56.0.0/ (see `mobile/AGENTS.md`)
